msgid "环境变量与编译选项"
msgstr "Environment Variables and Compiler Options"

msgid "本文面向Triton-Ascend算子开发者，提供编译、运行、调试和自动调优配置的查阅入口，说明各配置项的用途、默认值及A2/A3、950支持情况。环境变量用于设置进程内的编译与运行行为，编译选项用于配置单个kernel。旧配置的迁移方式集中在文末的[编译选项清理与兼容性](#compiler-option-cleanup-and-compatibility)。"
msgstr "This document is intended for Triton-Ascend operator developers. It provides a reference for compilation, running, debugging, and autotune configurations. It describes the purpose, default value, and A2/A3 and 950 support status of each configuration item. Environment variables configure in-process compilation and running behaviors, and compilation options configure a single kernel. The migration methods for old configurations are detailed at the end of this document in [Compiler Option Cleanup and Compatibility](#compiler-option-cleanup-and-compatibility)."

msgid "环境变量"
msgstr "Environment variable"

msgid "环境变量用法示例"
msgstr "Environment Variable Usage Examples"

msgid "在启动Python程序前，使用 `export` 设置环境变量。例如，设置 `TRITON_DEBUG=1` 开启调试功能："
msgstr "Before starting a Python program, use `export` to set environment variables. For example, set `TRITON_DEBUG=1` to enable the debugging feature:"

msgid "`export` 设置的变量会被当前终端后续启动的程序继承。若只需为一次运行设置变量，可将赋值写在命令前："
msgstr "Variables set by `export` are inherited by programs started later in the current terminal. If you only need to set a variable for a single run, place the assignment before the command:"

msgid "环境变量参考表"
msgstr "Environment Variable Reference Table"

msgid "950列包含Ascend 950PR/950DT；“—”表示不适用，编译模式限制见[编译选项参考表](#compiler-options-reference)。布尔环境变量除特别注明外可用 `1` 启用。"
msgstr "The 950 column includes Ascend 950PR/950DT; \"—\" indicates not applicable. For compilation mode restrictions, refer to the [compiler options reference table](#compiler-options-reference). You can enable boolean environment variables using `1` unless otherwise specified."

msgid "类别"
msgstr "Category"

msgid "功能说明"
msgstr "Functional Description"

msgid "默认值"
msgstr "Default value"

msgid "A2/A3"
msgstr "A2/A3"

msgid "950"
msgstr "950"

msgid "调试"
msgstr "Debugging"

msgid "`TRITON_DEBUG`"
msgstr "`TRITON_DEBUG`"

msgid "开启JIT调试及设备断言，保存TTIR；常规路径还输出编译日志并保存后端IR与二进制。"
msgstr "Enables JIT debugging and device assertions, and saves TTIR; the regular path also outputs compilation logs and saves backend IR and binaries."

msgid "关闭"
msgstr "Disable"

msgid "支持"
msgstr "Supported"

msgid "`USE_IR_LOC`"
msgstr "`USE_IR_LOC`"

msgid "以指定阶段的IR文件行号重建位置信息；当前AST编译可用 `ttir`，IR输入还可使用源文件位置快照。"
msgstr "Reconstruct position information using the IR file line numbers at a specified stage. Currently, AST compilation can use `ttir`, and IR input can also use source file position snapshots."

msgid "未设置"
msgstr "Not set"

msgid "`TRITON_FRONT_END_DEBUGGING`"
msgstr "`TRITON_FRONT_END_DEBUGGING`"

msgid "前端错误发生时保留原始Python异常堆栈。"
msgstr "Preserve the original Python exception stack trace when a frontend error occurs."

msgid "`TRITON_KERNEL_DUMP`"
msgstr "`TRITON_KERNEL_DUMP`"

msgid "保存编译阶段产物及最终 `npubin`；只对实际发生的编译生效。"
msgstr "Saves compilation stage artifacts and the final `npubin`; this takes effect only for compilations that actually occur."

msgid "`TRITON_DUMP_DIR`"
msgstr "`TRITON_DUMP_DIR`"

msgid "指定 `TRITON_KERNEL_DUMP` 的输出目录。"
msgstr "Specifies the output directory for `TRITON_KERNEL_DUMP`."

msgid "`$TRITON_HOME/.triton/dump`"
msgstr "`$TRITON_HOME/.triton/dump`"

msgid "`TRITON_DISABLE_LINE_INFO`"
msgstr "`TRITON_DISABLE_LINE_INFO`"

msgid "`true/1` 禁止向毕昇编译器请求行号信息；`false/0` 启用。"
msgstr "`true/1` disables requesting line number information from the BiSheng compiler; `false/0` enables it."

msgid "`true`"
msgstr "`true`"

msgid "常规路径"
msgstr "Default path"

msgid "`LLVM_EXTRACT_DI_LOCAL_VARIABLES`"
msgstr "`LLVM_EXTRACT_DI_LOCAL_VARIABLES`"

msgid "请求毕昇编译器生成调试变量信息。"
msgstr "Requests the BiSheng compiler to generate debug variable information."

msgid "`TRITON_DEVICE_PRINT`"
msgstr "`TRITON_DEVICE_PRINT`"

msgid "启用 `tl.device_print` 的设备端GM打印缓冲区。"
msgstr "Enable the device-side GM print buffer for `tl.device_print`."

msgid "`TRITON_MEMORY_DISPLAY`"
msgstr "`TRITON_MEMORY_DISPLAY`"

msgid "请求编译器输出内存使用信息。"
msgstr "Requests the compiler to output memory usage information."

msgid "—"
msgstr "—"

msgid "`ENABLE_PRINT_UB_BITS`"
msgstr "`ENABLE_PRINT_UB_BITS`"

msgid "请求编译器打印UB占用位数。"
msgstr "Requests the compiler to print the number of UB bits used."

msgid "`TRITON_INTERPRET`"
msgstr "`TRITON_INTERPRET`"

msgid "在CPU解释器中执行其支持的Triton操作，便于Python断点调试。"
msgstr "Execute supported Triton operations in the CPU interpreter to facilitate Python breakpoint debugging."

msgid "`TRITON_ENABLE_SANITIZER`"
msgstr "`TRITON_ENABLE_SANITIZER`"

msgid "向Ascend NPU编译器传入sanitizer开关。"
msgstr "Passes the sanitizer switch to the Ascend NPU compiler."

msgid "编译"
msgstr "Compilation"

msgid "`TRITON_ALWAYS_COMPILE`"
msgstr "`TRITON_ALWAYS_COMPILE`"

msgid "忽略命中的编译缓存，强制重新编译。"
msgstr "Ignore the matched compilation cache and force recompilation."

msgid "`TRITON_KERNEL_OVERRIDE`"
msgstr "`TRITON_KERNEL_OVERRIDE`"

msgid "从覆盖目录读取与编译阶段同名的外部IR/二进制文件。"
msgstr "Reads external IR/binary files with the same name as the compilation phase from the override directory."

msgid "`TRITON_OVERRIDE_DIR`"
msgstr "`TRITON_OVERRIDE_DIR`"

msgid "指定覆盖文件目录。"
msgstr "Specify the override file directory."

msgid "`$TRITON_HOME/.triton/override`"
msgstr "`$TRITON_HOME/.triton/override`"

msgid "`TRITON_F32_DEFAULT`"
msgstr "`TRITON_F32_DEFAULT`"

msgid "设置 `tl.dot` 的默认F32输入精度；Ascend使用 `ieee`、`hf32`，兼容输入 `tf32` 会映射为 `hf32`。"
msgstr "Set the default F32 input precision for `tl.dot`; Ascend uses `ieee` and `hf32`, and the compatible input `tf32` is mapped to `hf32`."

msgid "未设置，使用后端的 `ieee`"
msgstr "Not set, uses the backend `ieee`"

msgid "`TRITON_ALLOW_NON_CONSTEXPR_GLOBALS`"
msgstr "`TRITON_ALLOW_NON_CONSTEXPR_GLOBALS`"

msgid "允许JIT前端引用非 `constexpr` 全局变量。"
msgstr "Allows the JIT frontend to reference non-`constexpr` global variables."

msgid "`TRITON_ENABLE_LIBDEVICE`"
msgstr "`TRITON_ENABLE_LIBDEVICE`"

msgid "在A2/A3编译路径额外链接libdevice；非空字符串均视为开启，包括 `\"0\"`。"
msgstr "Additionally links libdevice in the A2/A3 compilation path; any non-empty string is treated as enabled, including `\"0\"`."

msgid "`TRITON_ENABLE_LIBDEVICE_SIMT`"
msgstr "`TRITON_ENABLE_LIBDEVICE_SIMT`"

msgid "在950上为libdevice调用选择SIMT版本；非空字符串均视为开启，包括 `\"0\"`。"
msgstr "Select the SIMT version for libdevice calls on 950; any non-empty string is considered enabled, including `\"0\"`."

msgid "缓存与调优"
msgstr "Cache and Tuning"

msgid "`TRITON_HOME`"
msgstr "`TRITON_HOME`"

msgid "设置Triton缓存、dump和override目录的根位置。"
msgstr "Set the root location for the Triton cache, dump, and override directories."

msgid "用户主目录"
msgstr "user home directory"

msgid "`TRITON_CACHE_DIR`"
msgstr "`TRITON_CACHE_DIR`"

msgid "指定编译缓存目录。"
msgstr "Specifies the compilation cache directory."

msgid "`$TRITON_HOME/.triton/cache`"
msgstr "`$TRITON_HOME/.triton/cache`"

msgid "`TRITON_CACHE_AUTOTUNING`"
msgstr "`TRITON_CACHE_AUTOTUNING`"

msgid "缓存autotune的选择结果。"
msgstr "Caches the autotune selection results."

msgid "`TRITON_PRINT_AUTOTUNING`"
msgstr "`TRITON_PRINT_AUTOTUNING`"

msgid "设为 `1` 时打印autotune结果及常规路径的编译命令。"
msgstr "When set to `1`, it prints the autotune results and the compilation commands for the regular path."

msgid "`TRITON_CACHE_MANAGER`"
msgstr "`TRITON_CACHE_MANAGER`"

msgid "用 `MODULE:CLASS` 指定编译缓存管理器；远程缓存设为 `triton.runtime.cache:RemoteCacheManager`。"
msgstr "Use `MODULE:CLASS` to specify the compilation cache manager; set the remote cache to `triton.runtime.cache:RemoteCacheManager`."

msgid "本地缓存管理器"
msgstr "Local Cache Manager"

msgid "`TRITON_REMOTE_CACHE_BACKEND`"
msgstr "`TRITON_REMOTE_CACHE_BACKEND`"

msgid "用 `MODULE:CLASS` 指定远程缓存的存储后端，需配合远程缓存管理器使用。"
msgstr "Use `MODULE:CLASS` to specify the storage backend for the remote cache. It must be used together with the remote cache manager."

msgid "`TRITON_ENABLE_UBTUNER`"
msgstr "`TRITON_ENABLE_UBTUNER`"

msgid "选择UB调优模式：`compile` 或 `run`。"
msgstr "Select the UB tuning mode: `compile` or `run`."

msgid "`TRITON_AUTOTUNE_PARALLEL_COMPILE`"
msgstr "`TRITON_AUTOTUNE_PARALLEL_COMPILE`"

msgid "控制Ascend autotune的并行编译，`0` 关闭。"
msgstr "Controls the parallel compilation of Ascend autotune; `0` disables it."

msgid "`1`"
msgstr "`1`"

msgid "`TRITON_BENCH_METHOD`"
msgstr "`TRITON_BENCH_METHOD`"

msgid "设为 `npu` 时选择Ascend的 `do_bench_npu`；`default` 使用通用测量方法。"
msgstr "When set to `npu`, it selects the Ascend `do_bench_npu`; `default` uses the general measurement method."

msgid "`default`"
msgstr "`default`"

msgid "运行"
msgstr "Run"

msgid "`TRITON_COMPILE_ONLY`"
msgstr "`TRITON_COMPILE_ONLY`"

msgid "设为 `1/true` 时不启动kernel；编译及launcher扩展加载仍会执行。"
msgstr "When set to `1/true`, the kernel is not launched; compilation and launcher extension loading still execute."

msgid "`TRITON_ENABLE_TASKQUEUE`"
msgstr "`TRITON_ENABLE_TASKQUEUE`"

msgid "控制Ascend launcher的task queue。"
msgstr "Controls the Ascend launcher task queue."

msgid "开启"
msgstr "Enable"

msgid "`TRITON_GRID_WARN_PRINT`"
msgstr "`TRITON_GRID_WARN_PRINT`"

msgid "打印Ascend launcher的grid大小警告。"
msgstr "Prints the Ascend launcher grid size warning."

msgid "`NPU_DEVICE_LIMIT`"
msgstr "`NPU_DEVICE_LIMIT`"

msgid "按 `AI Core数,Vector Core数` 限制可用核心数，例如 `14,28`；需符合设备比例。"
msgstr "Limit the number of available cores according to `AI Core count,Vector Core count`, for example, `14,28`; it must match the device ratio."

msgid "未设置，使用设备值"
msgstr "Not set. The device value is used."

msgid "工具链选择"
msgstr "Toolchain Selection"

msgid "`CC`"
msgstr "`CC`"

msgid "设置CPU launcher扩展的C/C++编译器。"
msgstr "Sets the C/C++ compiler for the CPU launcher extension."

msgid "未设置，使用系统默认编译器"
msgstr "If not set, the system default compiler is used."

msgid "`TRITON_NPU_COMPILER_PATH`"
msgstr "`TRITON_NPU_COMPILER_PATH`"

msgid "仅当随包工具与 `PATH` 查找均失败时，作为Ascend编译器工具目录的后备路径。"
msgstr "Serves as a fallback path for the Ascend compiler tool directory only when both the bundled tool and `PATH` lookup fail."

msgid "`TRITON_BUILD_DIR`"
msgstr "`TRITON_BUILD_DIR`"

msgid "查找 `triton-opt`、`triton-mlir-opt` 时，在随包工具之后、`PATH` 之前查找该目录的 `bin/`。"
msgstr "When searching for `triton-opt` and `triton-mlir-opt`, search the `bin/` directory of this directory after the bundled tools and before `PATH`."

msgid "编译选项"
msgstr "Compilation options"

msgid "编译选项用法示例"
msgstr "Compilation Option Usage Examples"

msgid "编译选项可以直接传入 `kernel[grid](...)`，也可以通过 `triton.Config` 设置自动调优的候选配置。`triton.Config` 的 `num_warps`、`num_stages` 和 `ir_override` 使用独立构造参数，其余受支持的编译选项放在 `kwargs` 中。"
msgstr "You can pass compilation options directly to `kernel[grid](...)`, or set candidate configurations for autotuning through `triton.Config`. The `num_warps`, `num_stages`, and `ir_override` parameters of `triton.Config` use separate constructor parameters. The remaining supported compilation options are placed in `kwargs`."

msgid "示例中，`BLOCK_SIZE` 是kernel自定义的 `tl.constexpr` 参数，`compile_mode` 和 `num_stages` 是编译选项："
msgstr "In the example, `BLOCK_SIZE` is a `tl.constexpr` parameter custom-defined by the kernel, and `compile_mode` and `num_stages` are compilation options:"

msgid "候选配置的使用方法见 [Autotune使用指南](./autotune_guide.md)。"
msgstr "For how to use candidate configurations, see the [Autotune Usage Guide](./autotune_guide.md)."

msgid "<a id=\"compiler-options-reference\"></a>"
msgstr "<a id=\"compiler-options-reference\"></a>"

msgid "<a id=\"compiler-options-reference\">"
msgstr "<a id=\"compiler-options-reference\">"

msgid "</a>"
msgstr "</a>"

msgid "编译选项参考表"
msgstr "Compiler Options Reference Table"

msgid "表中默认值以Ascend后端为准，`triton.Config` 的差异单独注明；`None` 通常表示由后端或工具链决定。"
msgstr "The default values in the table are based on the Ascend backend, and differences in `triton.Config` are noted separately; `None` typically indicates that the value is determined by the backend or toolchain."

msgid "**常规路径**：`compile_mode=\"simd\"` 或 `\"simd_simt_template\"`。"
msgstr "**Standard path**: `compile_mode=\"simd\"` or `\"simd_simt_template\"`."

msgid "**仅纯SIMT**：`compile_mode=\"simt_only\"`，仅950支持。"
msgstr "**Pure SIMT only**: `compile_mode=\"simt_only\"`, supported only by 950."

msgid "**需DynamicCV生效**：编译器成功应用了 [DynamicCV流水优化](./architecture_design_and_core_features.md#dynamic-cv-pipeline)，即950常规路径中启用 `enable_dynamic_cv_pipeline=True`，且未发生回退。"
msgstr "**Requires DynamicCV to take effect**: The compiler successfully applied [DynamicCV pipeline optimization](./architecture_design_and_core_features.md#dynamic-cv-pipeline); that is, `enable_dynamic_cv_pipeline=True` is enabled in the 950 regular path, and no fallback occurred."

msgid "默认值/可选值"
msgstr "Default value / optional value"

msgid "Triton通用"
msgstr "Triton General"

msgid "`debug`"
msgstr "`debug`"

msgid "开启设备断言与编译调试；JIT下与环境变量 `TRITON_DEBUG` 任一开启即生效。"
msgstr "Enable device assertion and compilation debugging; it takes effect if either the JIT option or the environment variable `TRITON_DEBUG` is enabled."

msgid "`False`；布尔值"
msgstr "`False`; boolean value"

msgid "`sanitize_overflow`"
msgstr "`sanitize_overflow`"

msgid "启用整数溢出检查；检查通过设备断言执行，还需启用 `debug`。"
msgstr "Enable integer overflow checking; the check is executed through device assertions, and you must also enable `debug`."

msgid "`True`；布尔值"
msgstr "`True`; boolean value"

msgid "`num_stages`"
msgstr "`num_stages`"

msgid "设为 `1` 时关闭自动多缓冲；其他值使用自动模式，不指定各层缓冲数量。"
msgstr "Setting this to `1` disables automatic multi-buffering; other values use the automatic mode and do not specify the number of buffers for each layer."

msgid "未设置 `multibuffer_mode` 时：后端 `2`，`triton.Config` 为 `3`；整数"
msgstr "When `multibuffer_mode` is not set: the backend is `2`, and `triton.Config` is `3`; integer"

msgid "`num_warps`"
msgstr "`num_warps`"

msgid "设置纯SIMT编译器的warp数。"
msgstr "Sets the number of warps for the pure SIMT compiler."

msgid "后端 `32`；`triton.Config` 为 `4`；正整数"
msgstr "Backend `32`; `triton.Config` is `4`; positive integer"

msgid "仅纯SIMT"
msgstr "Pure SIMT only"

msgid "`ir_override`"
msgstr "`ir_override`"

msgid "用给定文件覆盖同扩展名的编译阶段产物。"
msgstr "Overwrites compilation phase artifacts with the same extension using the specified file."

msgid "`None`；文件路径"
msgstr "`None`; file path"

msgid "编译模式与图优化"
msgstr "Compilation Mode and Graph Optimization"

msgid "`compile_mode`"
msgstr "`compile_mode`"

msgid "`simd` 使用SIMD；`simd_simt_template` 在A2/A3使用SIMD，在950启用模板SIMT子路径；`simt_only` 使用纯SIMT。"
msgstr "`simd` uses SIMD; `simd_simt_template` uses SIMD on A2/A3 and enables the template SIMT subpath on 950; `simt_only` uses pure SIMT."

msgid "`\"simd_simt_template\"`；另可选 `\"simd\"`、`\"simt_only\"`"
msgstr "`\"simd_simt_template\"`; alternatively, you can select `\"simd\"` or `\"simt_only\"`"

msgid "支持前两项"
msgstr "Supports the first two items"

msgid "支持全部"
msgstr "Supports all"

msgid "`enable_graph_optimize`"
msgstr "`enable_graph_optimize`"

msgid "控制TTIR Graph Optimization。"
msgstr "Controls TTIR Graph Optimization."

msgid "多缓冲"
msgstr "Multi-buffer"

msgid "`multibuffer`"
msgstr "`multibuffer`"

msgid "控制自动多缓冲总开关；`num_stages=1` 也会将其关闭。"
msgstr "Controls the master switch for automatic multi-buffering; `num_stages=1` also disables it."

msgid "`multibuffer_mode`"
msgstr "`multibuffer_mode`"

msgid "按 `gm`、`l1`、`l0c`、`ub` 设置多缓冲槽数；`1` 关闭该层多缓冲，大于 `1` 指定槽数。受 `multibuffer` 总开关控制，不能与 `num_stages` 同时显式设置。"
msgstr "Set the number of multi-buffer slots for `gm`, `l1`, `l0c`, and `ub`; `1` disables multi-buffer for the layer, and a value greater than `1` specifies the number of slots. The `multibuffer` master switch controls this option, and you cannot explicitly set it together with `num_stages`."

msgid "`None`；必须包含四个层级的字典，值为正的32位有符号整数"
msgstr "`None`; it must contain a four-level dictionary, and the values are positive 32-bit signed integers."

msgid "`set_workspace_multibuffer`"
msgstr "set_workspace_multibuffer"

msgid "设置workspace多缓冲级别；显式设置 `multibuffer_mode` 且 `gm>1` 时，NPU IR使用该GM槽数覆盖本值。"
msgstr "Sets the workspace multi-buffer level. When `multibuffer_mode` is explicitly set and `gm>1`, the NPU IR overrides this value with the GM slot count."

msgid "`None`；整数，具体范围由NPU编译器决定"
msgstr "`None`; an integer. The NPU compiler determines the specific range."

msgid "同步"
msgstr "Synchronization"

msgid "`sync_solver`"
msgstr "sync_solver"

msgid "控制HIVM graph sync solver。"
msgstr "Controls the HIVM graph sync solver."

msgid "`None`；布尔值"
msgstr "`None`; boolean value"

msgid "`unit_flag`"
msgstr "unit_flag"

msgid "控制HIVM unit-flag同步。"
msgstr "Controls HIVM unit-flag synchronization."

msgid "`inject_barrier_all`"
msgstr "inject_barrier_all"

msgid "控制自动注入barrier同步。"
msgstr "Controls the automatic injection of barrier synchronization."

msgid "`inject_block_all`"
msgstr "inject_block_all"

msgid "控制自动注入block同步。"
msgstr "Controls the automatic injection of block synchronization."

msgid "`disable_auto_inject_block_sync`"
msgstr "`disable_auto_inject_block_sync`"

msgid "禁用编译器自动插入核间同步。使用Ascend亲和接口 `sync_block_all`、`sync_block_set` 或 `sync_block_wait` 时，必须设置 `disable_auto_inject_block_sync=True`。"
msgstr "Disable automatic insertion of inter-core synchronization by the compiler. When using the Ascend affinity interfaces `sync_block_all`, `sync_block_set`, or `sync_block_wait`, you must set `disable_auto_inject_block_sync=True`."

msgid "调度与流水"
msgstr "Scheduling and Pipelining"

msgid "`enable_auto_bind_sub_block`"
msgstr "enable_auto_bind_sub_block"

msgid "覆盖后端推导的sub-block自动绑定策略。"
msgstr "Overrides the automatic sub-block binding strategy derived by the backend."

msgid "`enable_hivm_auto_cv_balance`"
msgstr "`enable_hivm_auto_cv_balance`"

msgid "控制HIVM的自动CV balance。"
msgstr "Controls the automatic CV balance of HIVM."

msgid "`tile_mix_vector_loop`"
msgstr "`tile_mix_vector_loop`"

msgid "设置Vector循环的切分份数。"
msgstr "Sets the tiling count for the Vector loop."

msgid "`None`；整数"
msgstr "`None`; integer"

msgid "`tile_mix_cube_loop`"
msgstr "`tile_mix_cube_loop`"

msgid "设置Cube循环的切分份数。"
msgstr "Sets the number of splits for the Cube loop."

msgid "`enable_mixed_cv`"
msgstr "`enable_mixed_cv`"

msgid "控制NPU编译器的mixed CV路径。"
msgstr "Controls the mixed CV path of the NPU compiler."

msgid "`enable_dynamic_cv_pipeline`"
msgstr "`enable_dynamic_cv_pipeline`"

msgid "启用950的 [DynamicCV流水优化](./architecture_design_and_core_features.md#dynamic-cv-pipeline)。优化生效时设置 `set_workspace_multibuffer=0`、`enable_mixed_cv=True`、`disable_auto_inject_block_sync=True`；若无法应用该优化，则恢复这些选项的原值并继续编译。"
msgstr "Enable the [DynamicCV pipeline optimization](./architecture_design_and_core_features.md#dynamic-cv-pipeline) for the 950. When the optimization takes effect, set `set_workspace_multibuffer=0`, `enable_mixed_cv=True`, and `disable_auto_inject_block_sync=True`; if the optimization cannot be applied, restore the original values of these options and continue compilation."

